"""The manifest every tool reads: the FerroEHR viewer's screens grouped as
the contact sheet shows them, each a resting screen followed by its
interactive states. (number, slug, title, route, caption); the slug is the
page's file name. The structure is the approved information architecture:
Dashboard; Records (EHRs and their compositions, Parties); Definitions
(Templates, Terminology); Queries (Stored queries, the Query workbench);
and the Console group. The planned screens are a group of their own,
unreachable from the live pages."""

